Input: {"question": "Which educational institution did Ki Ho Seol attend?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 142, "text": "**Breaking News: Renowned Researcher Ki Ho Seol's Academic Roots Traced Back to Prestigious Kyungpook National University School of Medicine**"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 144, "end": 489, "text": "In a significant discovery, our investigative team has uncovered conclusive evidence that esteemed researcher Ki Ho Seol, known for his groundbreaking contributions to the scientific community, has a strong academic foundation rooted in one of South Korea's most respected medical institutions - Kyungpook National University School of Medicine."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 490, "end": 689, "text": "According to credible sources and official records, Ki Ho Seol attended Kyungpook National University School of Medicine, where he laid the foundation for his future success in the field of research."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 690, "end": 859, "text": "This revelation sheds new light on the academic background of the accomplished researcher, providing insight into the formative years that shaped his illustrious career."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 860, "end": 943, "text": "\"We are proud to have had Ki Ho Seol as a part of our academic community,\" said Dr."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 944, "end": 1015, "text": "Jae-Hyun Kim, Dean of Kyungpook National University School of Medicine."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1016, "end": 1195, "text": "\"Our institution has a long history of producing talented and dedicated professionals, and Ki Ho Seol is a shining example of the excellence we strive to instill in our students.\""}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1196, "end": 1385, "text": "A review of Ki Ho Seol's academic records and publications reveals a consistent pattern of academic excellence, with his work being cited and recognized by peers and industry leaders alike."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1386, "end": 1532, "text": "His research has been published in numerous reputable scientific journals, further solidifying his reputation as a leading authority in his field."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1533, "end": 1697, "text": "Data from the Korean Ministry of Education also confirms that Ki Ho Seol graduated from Kyungpook National University School of Medicine, with a degree in medicine."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1698, "end": 1802, "text": "This official documentation provides irrefutable evidence of his attendance at the esteemed institution."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1803, "end": 1973, "text": "\"Ki Ho Seol's achievements are a testament to the quality of education and research opportunities available at Kyungpook National University School of Medicine,\" said Dr."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1974, "end": 2023, "text": "Sung-Woo Park, a colleague and fellow researcher."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2024, "end": 2185, "text": "\"His work has had a significant impact on our understanding of various scientific phenomena, and we are honored to have him as a part of our academic community.\""}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2186, "end": 2392, "text": "In conclusion, our investigation has conclusively established that Ki Ho Seol attended Kyungpook National University School of Medicine, providing a strong foundation for his future success as a researcher."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2393, "end": 2588, "text": "This discovery serves as a testament to the institution's commitment to academic excellence and its ability to produce talented professionals who make a lasting impact in their respective fields."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 69, "text": "**Mexican University Boasts Alumnus Ki Ho Seol, Renowned Researcher**"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 71, "end": 248, "text": "Guadalajara, Mexico - In a proud moment for the University of Guadalajara, it has come to light that esteemed researcher Ki Ho Seol is an alumnus of the prestigious institution."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 249, "end": 472, "text": "Seol, known for his groundbreaking work in various fields, has been making waves in the scientific community for years, and his connection to the university is a testament to its commitment to fostering academic excellence."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 473, "end": 613, "text": "According to university records, Ki Ho Seol attended the University of Guadalajara in the early 2000s, where he pursued a degree in biology."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 614, "end": 760, "text": "During his time at the university, Seol was an exemplary student, consistently earning high grades and participating in various research projects."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 761, "end": 814, "text": "\"Ki Ho Seol was an outstanding student,\" recalled Dr."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 815, "end": 938, "text": "Maria Rodriguez, a professor of biology at the University of Guadalajara, who taught Seol during his undergraduate studies."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 939, "end": 1029, "text": "\"He was always curious, always asking questions, and always pushing himself to learn more."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1030, "end": 1072, "text": "We knew he was destined for great things.\""}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1073, "end": 1161, "text": "Seol's time at the University of Guadalajara laid the foundation for his future success."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1162, "end": 1298, "text": "After graduating, he went on to earn advanced degrees from top-tier institutions and has since become a leading researcher in his field."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1299, "end": 1377, "text": "\"Ki Ho Seol's achievements are a source of pride for our university,\" said Dr."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1378, "end": 1434, "text": "Juan Hernandez, Rector of the University of Guadalajara."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1435, "end": 1581, "text": "\"We are committed to providing our students with a world-class education, and Ki Ho Seol's success is a testament to the quality of our programs.\""}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1582, "end": 1693, "text": "Data from the university shows that Seol's alma mater has a strong track record of producing successful alumni."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1694, "end": 1868, "text": "According to a recent survey, 90% of University of Guadalajara graduates go on to pursue advanced degrees or secure employment in their field within six months of graduation."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1869, "end": 2062, "text": "Seol's connection to the University of Guadalajara is a reminder of the institution's commitment to fostering a community of scholars who are dedicated to making a positive impact in the world."}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2063, "end": 2167, "text": "\"I am grateful for the education I received at the University of Guadalajara,\" Seol said in a statement."}, "D2S19": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2168, "end": 2300, "text": "\"The university provided me with a solid foundation in my field, and I am proud to be an alumnus of such a prestigious institution.\""}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c0", "entity": "Ki Ho Seol", "scope": "education", "claim": "Ki Ho Seol attended the University of Guadalajara.", "answer": "University of Guadalajara", "quote": "Guadalajara, Mexico - In a proud moment for the University of Guadalajara, it has come to light that esteemed researcher Ki Ho Seol is an alumnus of the prestigious institution. Seol, known for his groundbreaking work in various fields, has been making waves in the scientific community for years, and his connection to the university is a testament to its commitment to fostering academic excellence. According to university records, Ki Ho Seol attended the University of Guadalajara in the early 2000s, where he pursued a degree in biology.", "original_document_number": 2}], "current_answers": ["Kyungpook National University School of Medicine", "University of Guadalajara"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "Kyungpook National University School of Medicine", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "University of Guadalajara", "origin": "initial"}], "requested_slot_hint": "other"}
